This directory contains fully synthetic Qoder compound-session fixtures created
for Swob. No real transcript, account record, credential, or user data was read
or copied.

The project JSONL, `-session.json`, and nested `subagents/agent-*.jsonl` layout
was informed by kenn-io/agentsview at commit
1cd581fe34e87e134160c6668deffb674b7eaa4e. That implementation explicitly
records that no public producer-side Qoder session schema was available, so
Swob treats format provenance, usage, thinking, and Resume claims conservatively.

